5/19/2024 Trey Anastasio Band @ MTelus, Montreal , QC - Demons, second live performance
@CariniJams710 on Instagram if you enjoy this tab. I have also contributed Where They'll Find Us from the Trey Trio Mission Ballroom shows, and Everything Is Hollow by Kasvot Vaxt, from United Center 23'.
I love Demons ever since the debut 5/9/24 10 days earlier, which yielded some hilarious results as Trey and Dezron couldn't stop cracking up the idea and concept. A bit inside on the outside now, as per Trey branding provides. 
This second performance was much cleaner, Trey needed to do the song justice and arranged the chorus for the intro - a great hook, a great catch, and a mighty fine meal! 

I will yield transcribing the solo note for note as for timeliness, Trey is sticking to a vocal melody line in the key of each chord tone it seems. I will transcribe and edit this pull very soon, but I'd like to provide us Phans with a clean chord chart and lyric sheet for now.
It's SUCH AN EASY SONG! If you're just following along with the chords, sing along and have some fun! Play around! Get inspired!
Thank you for visiting the fabulous EmilsTabs.org website and thank you for learning. It's an honor to help the Phish community. Cheers all!


